id: pm-brand-trusted-activation
title: Activate independently adopted trusted identity protection
description: "PR 4 prepares a base-defined identity workflow and real Git bypass regression. A PR cannot activate its own trusted workflow. Independently adopt the reviewed workflow and gate on main, then require the trusted workflow result while retaining strict current-base validation, existing checks and admin enforcement. Verify candidate script and package-command edits cannot forge acceptance. Check the repository Actions event policy before activation. No protection mutation or merge is authorized in the review round."
