comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T06:44:54.987Z",codex-agent,"Follow-up from PR 4 thread 4305925234. Verified existing main protection has strict required verify (22), verify (26), analyze checks and admin enforcement, but no independently trusted identity context. Prepared workflow uses base definitions and base script only; exact-head real Git tests reject candidate no-op gate edits. Keep this item open until independent adoption, trusted-required-workflow activation and exact-head acceptance are verified."
